msgstr "Recursos"

# skip-rule: t-acc_obe
#: ../../resources_page.rst:24
msgid ""
"Note that, in addition to the resources listed below, the `\"Resources\" "
"category of krita-artists.org <https://krita-artists.org/c/resources/10/l/"
"top>`_ is probably the best place to find new brush packs, textures, and "
"other Krita resources. The community is very active and is always adding new "
"and interesting content."
msgstr ""
"Tingueu en compte que, a més dels recursos que s'enumeren a continuació, la "
"categoria `«Recursos» de krita-artists.org <https://krita-artists.org/c/"
"resources/10/l/top>`_ és probablement el millor lloc per a trobar paquets "
"nous de pinzells, textures i altres recursos del Krita. La comunitat és molt "
"activa i sempre està afegint contingut nou i interessant."

# skip-rule: t-acc_obe
#: ../../resources_page.rst:26
msgid ""
"Additionally, the `official Krita YouTube channel <https://www.youtube.com/"
"@KritaOrgPainting>`_ often features new brush packs, complete with demos and "
"free downloads."
msgstr ""
"A més, el `canal oficial de YouTube del Krita <https://www.youtube.com/"
"@KritaOrgPainting>`_ sovint presenta paquets nous de pinzells, completats "
"amb demostracions i descàrregues gratuïtes."

