#: ../../resources_page.rst:408
msgid ""
"An extension to VSCode that generates a Plugin Template for Krita (like "
"`Krita Script Starter`, but directly in VSCode)."
msgstr ""
"Una extensió de VSCode que genera una plantilla de connector per al Krita "
"(com l'`Iniciador de scripts del Krita`, però directament en VSCode)."

#: ../../resources_page.rst:410
msgid "Available here: https://github.com/cg-cnu/vscode-krita-plugin-generator"
msgstr ""
